gaa6(){return"A craving is a wave"},
gaa5(){return"A craving may rise and then subside. Its duration and intensity vary by person and situation. The four Ds on the SOS screen (Delay, Defer, Drink, Distract) offer simple ways to get through the moment; seek support if cravings become hard to manage."},
