B.bau={"0 800 23 13 13 \u2014 gratuit, anonyme, 7 j/7 de 8 h \xe0 2 h. Information et soutien, pour soi ou pour un proche.":0,"0 980 980 930 \u2014 7 j/7 de 8 h \xe0 2 h, anonyme et non surtax\xe9. Information, soutien, orientation, pour soi ou pour un proche.":1,"09 69 39 40 20 \u2014 \xe9coute 24 h/24 par des personnes pass\xe9es par l\xe0, groupes d'entraide gratuits partout en France.":2,"1 an":3,"1 mois":4,"1 sem":5,"1 \u2013 9 mois":6,"14 derniers jours":7,"2 sem":8,"2 sem \u2013 3 mois":9,"2 \u2013 4 sem":10,[u.s]:11,"3 mois":12,"30 secondes d'\xe9tirements":13,"39 89 \u2014 du lundi au samedi, 8 h \xe0 20 h. Tabacologues au bout du fil, suivi personnalis\xe9 gratuit.":14,"4 \u2013 6 sem":15,[u.n]:16,Accueil:17,Acier:18,"Adresse mail":19,Alcool:20,"Alcooliques Anonymes":21,[u.i]:22,"Annonce les phases inspirer, retenir et expirer.":23,Annuler:24,"Anxiolyse : biphasique. Apaisant \xe0 faible dose, anxiog\xe8ne \xe0 dose \xe9lev\xe9e.":25,Apparence:26,Appeler:27,"Appeler quelqu'un":28,[u.r]:29,Atteint:30,"Au d\xe9but, le joint ajoute quelque chose au-dessus de votre ligne de base. Apr\xe8s des ann\xe9es, il ram\xe8ne simplement \xe0 z\xe9ro : votre ligne de base a baiss\xe9, et le joint ne fait que la remonter jusqu'\xe0 son ancien niveau.":31,"Aucun d\xe9clencheur not\xe9 pour l'instant.":32,"Aucune corr\xe9lation d\xe9tectable sur vos donn\xe9es.":33,"Aucune entr\xe9e pour l'instant.":34,[u.A4]:35,[u.F1]:36,"Avant / Maintenant":37,"Avant de commencer":38,"Bel apr\xe8s-midi":39,"Boire un grand verre d'eau":40,"Bois un verre d'eau.":41,Bonjour:42,Bonsoir:43,"Bronchodilatation aigu\xeb : contrairement au tabac. Ce qui ab\xeeme le poumon, c'est la fum\xe9e, pas la mol\xe9cule. C'est tout l'argument du vaporisateur.":44,[u.cb]:45,"C'est la fum\xe9e qui fait l'essentiel des d\xe9g\xe2ts \u2014 goudrons, particules, monoxyde de carbone \u2014 bien plus que la nicotine elle-m\xeame.":46,"C'est maintenant.":47,"C'est parti":48,"C'est pass\xe9":49,"CONFIDENTIALIT\xc9":50,"Cahier de bord":51,[u.k]:52,"Cardiovasculaire : m\xe9ta-analyse de 24 \xe9tudes (Heart, 2025) \u2014 risque accru d'infarctus, d'AVC et de mortalit\xe9 cardiovasculaire.":53,"Ce champ est requis.":54,[u.A]:55,"Ce matin":56,[u.H]:57,"Ce que cette app ne fait jamais":58,"Ce que cette application sait, d'o\xf9 elle le tient, et ce qu'elle ne pr\xe9tend pas savoir. Chaque affirmation porte son niveau de preuve \u2014 ouvrez les modules qui vous concernent.":59,"Ce que dit la science":60,Cent:61,"Cent envies travers\xe9es.":62,"Centres de Soins, d'Accompagnement et de Pr\xe9vention en Addictologie. Gratuits, anonymes, sans jugement \u2014 cherchez \xab CSAPA \xbb suivi du nom de votre ville.":63,[u.lH]:64,[u.F]:65,[u.G]:66,"Ces ressources ne sont pas l\xe0 parce que la situation serait grave. Elles sont l\xe0 parce que se faire aider augmente nettement les chances de r\xe9ussite \u2014 et que certains caps se passent mieux accompagn\xe9. Tous ces services sont habitu\xe9s aux appels \xab juste pour poser une question \xbb.":67,[u.b]:68,"Cet objectif":69,[u.f2]:70,"Cette adresse mail ne semble pas valide.":71,"Cette journ\xe9e compte d\xe9j\xe0. Prenez soin de vous ce soir.":72,"Cette \xe9tape touche \xe0 sa fin.":73,"Changement de phase":74,"Chaque jour compte":75,[u.DV]:76,Chaude:77,"Chez les personnes en douleur chronique, le cannabis continue d'apporter un b\xe9n\xe9fice au sommeil via le soulagement de la douleur, m\xeame quand la tol\xe9rance s'installe sur ses effets directs. Traite la douleur, et une partie de ce que le joint fait devient inutile. C'est un chemin de sortie, pas une condamnation.":78,"Choisis au moins une addiction \xe0 suivre.":79,[u.ul]:80,"Choisissez votre langue":81,[u.hS]:82,"Cinq minutes":83,[u.oQ]:84,Clair:85,"Cognition : d\xe9ficits l\xe9gers et r\xe9versibles chez l'adulte. Les pertes durables concernent l'usage d\xe9but\xe9 \xe0 l'adolescence. Mais en pluriquotidien, on n'entre jamais dans la fen\xeatre de r\xe9cup\xe9ration.":86,Comestible:87,"Comment elle fonctionne":88,"Comprendre l'envie":89,Connaissance:90,"Conserve le design avec des mouvements plus calmes.":91,Constance:92,Constats:93,"Contraste renforc\xe9":94,"Convertisseur d'objectif":95,Coucher:96,"Co\xfbt de l'alcool par semaine (\u20ac)":97,"Co\xfbt du cannabis par semaine (\u20ac)":98,"Co\xfbt du tabac par semaine (\u20ac)":99,"Cr\xe9atine monohydrate, 3 g/j \xe0 65 kg, tous les jours, sans phase de charge.":100,"D'abord, la s\xe9curit\xe9":101,Debout:102,"Derni\xe8re consommation \u2192 coucher":103,"Des rappels utiles, r\xe9glables et toujours discrets.":104,"Deux minutes pour le cahier de bord":105,"Diff\xe9rer":106,Diluer:107,Distraire:108,[u.Ca]:109,"Dix envies travers\xe9es.":110,"Dix fois":111,"Douleur chronique : preuves substantielles (National Academies, 2017).":112,"Dur\xe9e":113,[u.D]:114,"Dur\xe9e moyenne":115,"Dur\xe9e moyenne de r\xe9sistance":116,"D\xe9caler":117,"D\xe9clencheur, routine, r\xe9compense":118,"D\xe9clencheurs d'envie les plus fr\xe9quents":119,"D\xe9couplage":120,"D\xe9pendance : 8 \xe0 19 % des usagers remplissent les crit\xe8res d'un trouble de l'usage. Aucun m\xe9dicament approuv\xe9.":121,"EXP\xc9RIENCE ADAPTATIVE":122,Enregistrer:123,"Entre un \xe2ge entre 12 et 120 ans.":124,"Envies travers\xe9es":125,Expire:126,"Export pr\xeat, choisis o\xf9 l'envoyer.":127,"Exporter mes donn\xe9es":128,"Faire le test (2 min)":129,"Faisons connaissance":130,"Faites autre chose de vos mains.":131,"Fen\xeatre sans fum\xe9e":132,Fermer:133,"Fin de phase 0 \xb7 Analyse d\xe9bloqu\xe9e":134,Fonte:135,[u.hb]:136,"F\xe9minin":137,Genre:138,"Gestion du sommeil":139,"Go\xfbt et odorat commencent \xe0 revenir":140,"Guidage vocal du SOS":141,"Heure de lever fixe 7 j/7. Lumi\xe8re naturelle 10 min apr\xe8s le lever. Chambre \xe0 17\u201319 \xb0C. Si pas endormi apr\xe8s 20 min : se lever, autre pi\xe8ce, revenir quand le sommeil vient (contr\xf4le par le stimulus, pilier de la TCC-I, sup\xe9rieure aux somnif\xe8res sur le long terme).":142,"Heure de lever fixe, 7 j/7":143,[u.BG]:144,Historique:145,"Honn\xeatet\xe9 : pas de dose l\xe9tale connue, pas de toxicit\xe9 h\xe9patique. Compar\xe9 \xe0 l'alcool, la balance n'est pas d\xe9favorable.":146,"Humeur au r\xe9veil /10":147,"Humeur au r\xe9veil et qualit\xe9 de sommeil":148,"Hydratation, sel les jours de forte sueur.":149,"Hygi\xe8ne de vie":150,"Hyper\xe9m\xe8se cannabique : vomissements cycliques, soulag\xe9s par des douches tr\xe8s chaudes. Rare, souvent diagnostiqu\xe9 avec des ann\xe9es de retard.":151,"Il n'existe pas de seuil de consommation sans risque : le risque augmente d\xe8s les premiers verres r\xe9guliers \u2014 et il baisse d\xe8s qu'on r\xe9duit.":152,Inspire:153,[u.gP]:154,"J'ai compris":155,"J'ai consomm\xe9":156,J10:157,"J2 \u2013 J6":158,"Je redescends":159,"Joint avec tabac":160,"Joint avec tabac \u2192 nicotine + THC + combustion \u2192 sommeil < 6 h \u2192 r\xe9cup\xe9ration r\xe9duite et seuil de douleur abaiss\xe9 \u2192 r\xe9veils nocturnes \u2192 sommeil < 6 h. Plusieurs probl\xe8mes, une seule cause.":161,"Joint pur":162,"Joints/jour":163,"L'alcool aide \xe0 s'endormir mais fragmente la seconde moiti\xe9 de la nuit : r\xe9veils, sueurs, sommeil non r\xe9parateur. Apr\xe8s l'arr\xeat, le sommeil commence \xe0 se r\xe9parer d\xe8s les premi\xe8res semaines \u2014 et si vous buviez beaucoup, il peut lui falloir plus de temps : c'est normal, et cela continue de s'am\xe9liorer.":164,[u.t3]:165,[u.rc]:166,"L'ann\xe9e":167,"L'application":168,"L'envie est une vague":169,[u.tT]:170,"L'honn\xeatet\xe9":171,LANGUE:172,"La boucle":173,"La corr\xe9lation":174,[u.eG]:175,"La douleur aussi se retourne : l'arr\xeat brutal peut provoquer une hyperalg\xe9sie. Une partie de \xab \xe7a me soulage \xbb peut \xeatre le soulagement du manque entre deux prises. De l'int\xe9rieur, c'est indiscernable.":176,"La nuance qui joue en votre faveur":177,"La saison":178,"La semaine":179,[u.w4]:180,"Langue de l\u2019application":181,"Le THC raccourcit l'endormissement mais supprime le sommeil paradoxal. En usage chronique, la tol\xe9rance \xe9rode le b\xe9n\xe9fice ; le d\xe9ficit de REM demeure. Les usagers quotidiens rapportent plus de troubles du sommeil que les usagers occasionnels ou les non-usagers. Une revue pharmacologique conclut que le THC n'est pas appropri\xe9 dans l'insomnie chronique, du fait de l'accoutumance, de l'allongement du d\xe9lai d'endormissement et de la somnolence diurne.":182,[u.oX]:183,"Le cahier vous attend":184,[u.Dt]:185,"Le mois":186,[u.gQ]:187,"Le monoxyde s'en va":188,"Le paradoxe du sommeil":189,"Le premier graphique":190,"Le programme par phases":191,"Le retour":192,"Le seuil":193,"Le sommeil":194,"Le sommeil se retourne : sch\xe9ma biphasique, b\xe9n\xe9fice initial puis d\xe9gradation li\xe9e \xe0 la tol\xe9rance (\xe9tude EEG \xe0 domicile).":195,[u.xw]:196,[u.rW]:197,"Lecteur de preuves":198,"Les 4 D":199,"Les b\xe9n\xe9fices arrivent vite : le monoxyde de carbone est \xe9limin\xe9 en 12 \xe0 24 h, le go\xfbt et l'odorat reviennent en quelques jours \u2014 le d\xe9tail vous attend dans Paliers sant\xe9.":200,"Les b\xe9n\xe9fices de la r\xe9duction se mesurent vite : tension art\xe9rielle, foie, \xe9nergie, peau, budget \u2014 le d\xe9tail vous attend dans Paliers sant\xe9.":201,[u.AX]:202,[u.no]:203,"Les qu\xeates du jour arrivent chaque matin.":204,"Les signes qui m\xe9ritent un m\xe9decin":205,"Les substituts nicotiniques (patchs, gommes, pastilles) augmentent nettement les chances de r\xe9ussite, et leurs risques sont sans commune mesure avec ceux de la cigarette. Le dosage se r\xe8gle avec un m\xe9decin ou un pharmacien.":206,[u.aL]:207,[u.hf]:208,[u.bx]:209,"Les trois valid\xe9es : +50 XP de bonus.":210,Lever:211,"Lire un module \xc0 propos":212,Maintenant:213,Masculin:214,[u.AJ]:215,"Mes addictions":216,"Message du jour":217,Minerai:218,"Mode discret":219,"M\xe9daille obtenue":220,"M\xe9daille \xab Le monoxyde s'en va \xbb":221,"M\xe9daille \xab Sans combustion \xbb":222,[u.yA]:223,"M\xe9daille \xab S\xe9par\xe9 \xbb":224,"M\xe9dailles":225,"Navigation simplifi\xe9e":226,"Niveaux de preuve":227,"Nom de l'objectif (optionnel)":228,"Note libre":229,"Noter une envie dans le SOS":230,[u.oL]:231,"Nuit par nuit":232,"Nuits courtes":233,[u.CW]:234,"Num\xe9ro national de pr\xe9vention du suicide \u2014 gratuit, 24 h/24, 7 j/7.":235,"Objectif (\u20ac)":236,[u.a2]:237,"Ouvrez Respire pour noter votre nuit.":238,PERSONNALISATION:239,"Paliers sant\xe9":240,"Paliers sant\xe9 atteints":241,"Par an":242,"Par jour":243,"Par mois":244,"Par semaine":245,"Pas de reproche.":246,"Pas encore assez de donn\xe9es pour cette comparaison.":247,[u.xN]:248,"Pas encore d'envie travers\xe9e \xe0 mesurer.":249,Pliage:250,"Premier matin":251,[u.oH]:252,Progression:253,"Prot\xe9ines 1,6\u20132 g/kg, r\xe9parties en 4 prises.":254,"Prot\xe9ines estim\xe9es (g)":255,"Pr\xe9nom":256,"Qu'avez-vous consomm\xe9 ?":257,"Qu'est-ce que vous souhaitez arr\xeater ?":258,"Qualit\xe9":259,"Qualit\xe9 /10":260,"Qualit\xe9 de la nuit /10":261,"Qualit\xe9 en berne":262,"Qualit\xe9 moyenne":263,"Quand consulter":264,[u.hK]:265,[u.zh]:266,"Quatre-vingt-dix matins not\xe9s.":267,"Qu\xeates":268,"Radar de vigilance":269,"Ranger un outil":270,Recommandations:271,Recuit:272,"Redescendre d'une phase":273,"Redescendre d'une phase ?":274,"Refaire le test":275,"Relire le disclaimer":276,"Remplir le cahier du matin":277,"Rendez-vous pris":278,[u.s3]:279,[u.bf]:280,"Respecter la fen\xeatre sans fum\xe9e ce soir":281,"Respiratoire : toux, expectorations, bronchite. Risque sup\xe9rieur avec tabac associ\xe9.":282,[u.ek]:283,"Respire \xe0 votre fa\xe7on":284,"Respire, avec le cercle ci-dessus.":285,Ressources:286,Retiens:287,[u.ib]:288,"Route des paliers":289,"R\xe9cup\xe9ration physique":290,"R\xe9duire les animations":291,"R\xe9glages":292,"R\xe9partition horaire des consommations":293,"R\xe9p\xe9t\xe9 trois fois.":294,"R\xe9silience":295,"R\xe9sistance":296,"R\xe9veil":297,"R\xe9veil nocturne":298,"R\xe9veils":299,"R\xe9veils cette nuit":300,"R\xe9veils nocturnes fr\xe9quents":301,"R\xe9veils par nuit":302,"S'offrir une pause \xe9tirements":303,"SOS envie":304,"Sans combustion":305,"Sauvegarde JSON compl\xe8te et cahier de bord en CSV":306,"Sept jours cumul\xe9s sans combustion.":307,"Sept matins not\xe9s.":308,[u.aX]:309,[u.xK]:310,"Si vous buvez beaucoup et tous les jours, ne vous arr\xeatez jamais brutalement seul. Le sevrage d'alcool est le seul des trois qui peut \xeatre physiquement dangereux : tremblements, sueurs et agitation dans les heures qui suivent l'arr\xeat, et dans les cas s\xe9v\xe8res confusion ou crises convulsives dans les premiers jours \u2014 l\xe0, c'est une urgence : appelez le 15. La descente se pr\xe9pare avec un m\xe9decin, et c'est exactement ce que la piste alcool de cette application vous aide \xe0 faire, progressivement.":311,Sombre:312,Sommeil:313,"Sommeil et dernier joint":314,"Sommeil \xe0 court terme : preuves mod\xe9r\xe9es, dans certaines conditions m\xe9dicales.":315,"Sortir prendre l'air 2 min":316,Soudure:317,Souffle:318,"Souffle vivant":319,"Spasticit\xe9 : essai CAMS, 630 patients, \u221261 % spasticit\xe9 et douleur.":320,"Substitut nicotinique":321,Substituts:322,"Substituts au geste et au rituel":323,"Substituts nicotiniques":324,"Supprimer d\xe9finitivement":325,"Supprimer toutes mes donn\xe9es":326,[u.yQ]:327,"Syst\xe8me":328,[u.BZ]:329,"S\xe9par\xe9":330,Tabac:331,[u.yE]:332,"Texte agrandi":333,[u.ry]:334,"Tout supprimer ?":335,"Toutes addictions":336,"Toutes les donn\xe9es ont \xe9t\xe9 supprim\xe9es.":337,"Toux et essoufflement diminuent":338,"Tremblements, sueurs ou agitation quelques heures apr\xe8s le dernier verre : consulte rapidement \u2014 ce sont des signes de sevrage physique, qui se traitent tr\xe8s bien quand ils sont anticip\xe9s.":339,Trempe:340,"Trente jours cumul\xe9s sans combustion.":341,"Trente matins not\xe9s.":342,[u.id]:343,"Trois petites qu\xeates par jour. Jamais obligatoires, jamais de p\xe9nalit\xe9 \u2014 juste de l'XP \xe0 prendre.":344,"Trois retours":345,[u.FB]:346,"Un matin \xe0 la fois. Vous pouvez \xeatre fier de ce pas.":347,"Un professionnel a \xe9t\xe9 consult\xe9.":348,"Un seul rappel, apr\xe8s 3 jours de silence":349,"Un verre \xab standard \xbb \u2248 10 g d'alcool pur : un demi de bi\xe8re, un ballon de vin, une dose de spiritueux. Les verres servis \xe0 la maison font souvent le double.":350,[u.wr]:351,[u.De]:352,"Une envie monte, culmine, puis redescend \u2014 le plus souvent en quelques minutes, parfois un peu plus au d\xe9but. Vous n'avez pas \xe0 la combattre : vous avez juste \xe0 attendre qu'elle passe. Les 4 D de l'\xe9cran SOS (Diff\xe9rer, D\xe9caler, Diluer, Distraire) sont quatre fa\xe7ons d'occuper le sommet de la vague. Chaque vague travers\xe9e sans consommer rend la suivante un peu plus facile.":353,"Une envie travers\xe9e jusqu'au bout.":354,[u.uw]:355,[u.mY]:356,"Une id\xe9e, tout de suite":357,"Une premi\xe8re entr\xe9e dans le cahier.":358,[u.EH]:359,"VOS OBJECTIFS":360,"VOTRE PROFIL":361,"VOTRE RYTHME":362,Vaporisateur:363,"Verre d'alcool":364,"Verrouill\xe9e":365,[u.ow]:366,"Vitamine D apr\xe8s dosage sanguin, 1500\u20132000 UI/j d'octobre \xe0 avril \xe0 45\xb0 de latitude.":367,"Voir la suite":368,"Vos donn\xe9es":369,"Vos donn\xe9es vous appartiennent":370,[u.a9]:371,[u.vD]:372,[u.Bn]:373,[u.w3]:374,"Vous pouvez \xeatre fier du chemin parcouru.":375,faible:376,forte:377,"mod\xe9r\xe9e":378,"\xab Juste une \xbb r\xe9veille le circuit au moment o\xf9 il s'\xe9teint. Le risque est maximal les premi\xe8res semaines : pr\xe9parez votre r\xe9ponse aux d\xe9clencheurs (caf\xe9, alcool, pauses) plut\xf4t que de compter sur la volont\xe9 du moment.":379,"\xc0 propos":380,"\xc0 venir":381,"\xc2ge":382,[u.fW]:383,"\xc9bauche":384,"\xc9conomies":385,"\xc9conomis\xe9 depuis le d\xe9but":386,"\xc9coute imm\xe9diate":387,"\xc9tude du THC : ce qu'il apporte":388,"\xc9tude du THC : ce qu'il co\xfbte":389,"\xc9valuation":390}
B.b7K=new A.a3(B.bau,["0 800 23 13 13 \u2014 free, anonymous, 7 days a week from 8 a.m. to 2 a.m. Information and support for yourself or someone close to you.","0 980 980 930 \u2014 7 days a week from 8 a.m. to 2 a.m., anonymous and charged at the standard rate. Information, support, and guidance for yourself or someone close to you.","09 69 39 40 20 \u2014 24/7 support from people with lived experience, with free peer-support groups throughout France.","1 year","1 month","1 wk","1\u20139 months","Last 14 days","2 wks","2 wks \u2013 3 months","2\u20134 wks","Three substance-free hours before bed","3 months","Stretch for 30 seconds","39 89 \u2014 Monday to Saturday, 8 a.m. to 8 p.m. Tobacco specialists and free personalized follow-up.","4\u20136 wks","Makes text and controls more prominent.","Home","Steel","Email address","Alcohol","Alcoholics Anonymous","Reduces the menu to essential features.","Announces the breathe in, hold, and breathe out phases.","Cancel","Anxiety effects are biphasic: calming at low doses, anxiety-provoking at high doses.","Appearance","Call","Call someone",u.f,"Reached","At first, the joint adds something above your baseline. After years, it simply brings you back to zero: your baseline has fallen, and the joint only returns it to its former level.","No triggers have been logged yet.","No detectable correlation in your data.","No entries yet.",u.Am,"Increases text size throughout the app.","Before / Now","Before you begin","Good afternoon","Drink a large glass of water","Drink a glass of water.","Good morning","Good evening","Acute bronchodilation, unlike tobacco. Smoke damages the lungs, not the molecule itself. This is the entire rationale for a vaporizer.","Done. Welcome to this new stage.","Smoke causes most of the damage \u2014 tar, particles, and carbon monoxide \u2014 far more than nicotine itself.","The time is now.","Let\u2019s begin","It passed","PRIVACY","Journal","Journal saved. Two minutes, as planned.","Cardiovascular health: meta-analysis of 24 studies (Heart, 2025) found increased risk of heart attack, stroke, and cardiovascular mortality.","This field is required.",u.ss,"This morning","Not now. Just not now.","What this app never does","What this app knows, where that knowledge comes from, and what it does not claim to know. Every statement includes its evidence level \u2014 open the modules that are relevant to you.","What science says","One hundred","One hundred cravings crossed.","French addiction care, support, and prevention centers. Free, anonymous, and non-judgmental \u2014 search \u2018CSAPA\u2019 plus your town name.",u.A1,u.fQ,u.zi,"These resources are not here because your situation must be severe. They are here because support significantly improves the chances of success, and some milestones are easier with help. These services are used to calls made \u2018just to ask a question\u2019.",u.kp,"This goal",u.q4,"This email address does not look valid.","Today already matters. Take care of yourself tonight.","This stage is coming to an end.","Phase change","Every day counts",u.tG,"Heat","For people with chronic pain, cannabis can keep supporting sleep through pain relief even when tolerance develops to its direct effects. Treat the pain, and part of what the joint does becomes unnecessary. That is a path out, not a sentence.","Choose at least one addiction to track.",u.E,"Choose your language",u.a0,"Five minutes","Circulation and lung function improve","Light","Cognition: mild and reversible deficits in adults. Lasting losses mainly concern use that began in adolescence. With use several times a day, however, the recovery window never opens.","Edible","How it works","Understanding cravings","Knowledge","Keeps the design while making movement calmer.","Consistency","Insights","Higher contrast","Goal calculator","Bedtime","Weekly alcohol cost (\u20ac)","Weekly cannabis cost (\u20ac)","Weekly tobacco cost (\u20ac)","Creatine monohydrate: 3 g/day at 65 kg, every day, with no loading phase.","Safety first","Standing","Last use \u2192 bedtime","Useful, adjustable reminders that always remain discreet.","Two minutes for your journal","Delay","Drink","Distract",u.ge,"Ten cravings crossed.","Ten times","Chronic pain: substantial evidence (National Academies, 2017).","Duration",u.na,"Average duration","Average resistance duration","Defer","Cue, routine, reward","Most frequent craving triggers","Decoupling","Dependence: 8 to 19% of users meet criteria for a use disorder. No medication is approved.","ADAPTIVE EXPERIENCE","Save","Enter an age between 12 and 120.","Cravings crossed","Breathe out","Export ready. Choose where to send it.","Export my data","Take the test (2 min)","Let\u2019s get acquainted","Do something else with your hands.","Smoke-free window","Close","End of phase 0 \xb7 Analysis unlocked","Smelting",u.Eo,"Female","Gender","Sleep management","Taste and smell begin to return","SOS voice guidance","Use a fixed wake-up time 7 days a week. Get 10 minutes of natural light after waking. Keep the bedroom at 17\u201319 \xb0C. If you are not asleep after 20 minutes, get up, go to another room, and return when sleepy (stimulus control, a core CBT-I technique that outperforms sleeping pills over time).","Consistent wake-up time, 7 days a week","Hours between last use and bedtime","History","An honest balance: no known lethal dose and no liver toxicity. Compared with alcohol, the balance is not unfavorable.","Mood on waking /10","Mood on waking and sleep quality","Hydration, plus salt on days with heavy sweating.","Lifestyle","Cannabinoid hyperemesis: cyclical vomiting relieved by very hot showers. Rare and often diagnosed years late.","There is no risk-free level of alcohol use: risk rises from the first regular drinks \u2014 and falls as soon as you reduce.","Breathe in",u.cV,"I understand","I used","Day 10","Days 2\u20136","Move back","Joint with tobacco","Joint with tobacco \u2192 nicotine + THC + combustion \u2192 sleep under 6 h \u2192 poorer recovery and a lower pain threshold \u2192 night waking \u2192 sleep under 6 h. Several problems, one cause.","Pure joint","Joints/day","Alcohol helps you fall asleep but fragments the second half of the night: waking, sweating, and unrefreshing sleep. Sleep begins to recover in the first weeks after stopping. If you drank heavily, it may take longer; that is normal, and improvement continues.","The end-of-phase-0 analysis was viewed.",u.qb,"The year","The app","A craving is a wave",u.B0,"Honesty","LANGUAGE","The loop","The correlation",u.Dl,"Pain can reverse too: abrupt cessation may cause hyperalgesia. Part of \u2018it relieves me\u2019 may be relief from withdrawal between uses. From the inside, the two are indistinguishable.","The nuance that works in your favor","The season","The week",u.qh,"App language","THC shortens sleep onset but suppresses REM sleep. With chronic use, tolerance erodes the benefit while the REM deficit remains. Daily users report more sleep problems than occasional users or non-users. A pharmacological review concludes that THC is unsuitable for chronic insomnia because of tolerance, longer sleep-onset delay, and daytime drowsiness.",u.gy,"Your journal is waiting",u.mc,"The month","Carbon monoxide clears from the blood","Carbon monoxide leaves","The sleep paradox","The first chart","The phased program","The return","The threshold","Sleep","Sleep reverses: a biphasic pattern, with an initial benefit followed by tolerance-related deterioration (home EEG study).","Excess coronary risk is reduced by half",u.cd,"Evidence reader","The 4 Ds","Benefits arrive quickly: carbon monoxide clears within 12 to 24 hours, and taste and smell begin returning within days \u2014 see Health milestones for details.","The benefits of reducing can be measured quickly: blood pressure, liver health, energy, skin, and budget \u2014 see Health milestones for details.",u.g8,"All ten About modules were opened.","Today\u2019s quests arrive each morning.","Signs worth discussing with a doctor","Nicotine replacement products (patches, gum, lozenges) significantly improve the chances of success, and their risks are incomparable with those of cigarettes. Dosage should be adjusted with a doctor or pharmacist.",u.am,u.mj,u.hO,"Complete all three: +50 bonus XP.","Wake-up","Read an About module","Now","Male","Hides sensitive terms in notifications.","My addictions","Daily message","Ore","Discreet mode","Medal earned","\u2018Carbon monoxide leaves\u2019 medal","\u2018Smoke-free\u2019 medal","\u2018Breath\u2019 medal \xb7 90-day summary","\u2018Separated\u2019 medal","Medals","Simplified navigation","Evidence levels","Goal name (optional)","Free note","Log a craving in SOS",u.sH,"Night by night","Short nights",u.n7,"France\u2019s national suicide prevention number \u2014 free, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.","Goal (\u20ac)",u.xM,"Open Respire to record your night.","PERSONALIZATION","Health milestones","Health milestones reached","Per year","Per day","Per month","Per week","No blame.","There is not enough data for this comparison yet.",u.wy,"No completed cravings to measure yet.","Folding","First morning","First tobacco-free use logged.","Progress","Protein: 1.6\u20132 g/kg, divided across four servings.","Estimated protein (g)","First name","What did you use?","What would you like to stop?","Quality","Quality /10","Sleep quality /10","Low sleep quality","Average quality","When to seek help","Fourteen entries: insights are unlocked.",u.cl,"Ninety mornings logged.","Quests","Awareness radar","Put one tool away","Recommendations","Annealing","Move back one phase","Move back one phase?","Retake the test","Read the disclaimer again","Complete the morning journal","Appointment made",u.h,u.CR,"Respect the smoke-free window tonight","Respiratory health: cough, sputum, and bronchitis. Risk is higher when tobacco is also used.",u.l4,"Respire, your way","Breathe with the circle above.","Resources","Hold",u.gC,"Milestone road","Physical recovery","Reduce motion","Settings","Hourly distribution of use","Repeated three times.","Resilience","Resistance","Wake-up","Night wake-up","Wake-ups","Wake-ups last night","Frequent night-time waking","Wake-ups per night","Take a stretching break","Craving SOS","Smoke-free","Complete JSON backup and journal in CSV",u.cZ,"Seven mornings logged.",u.i7,u.k_,"If you drink heavily every day, never stop abruptly on your own. Alcohol withdrawal is the only one of these three that can be physically dangerous: tremors, sweating, and agitation in the hours after stopping, and in severe cases confusion or seizures during the first days. That is an emergency: call 15 in France or your local emergency number. Reduction should be planned with a doctor, and the alcohol track helps you prepare gradually.","Dark","Sleep","Sleep and last joint","Short-term sleep: moderate evidence in certain medical conditions.","Step outside for 2 min","Welding","Breath","Living breath","Spasticity: CAMS trial, 630 patients, 61% reduction in spasticity and pain.","Nicotine replacement","Substitutes","Substitutes for the gesture and ritual","Nicotine replacement","Delete permanently","Delete all my data",u.DR,"System",u.BV,"Separated","Tobacco",u.w1,"Larger text",u.qS,"Delete everything?","All addictions","All data has been deleted.","Coughing and breathlessness decrease","Tremors, sweating, or agitation a few hours after the last drink: seek medical advice promptly. These are signs of physical withdrawal, which is very treatable when anticipated.","Quenching",u.D7,"Thirty mornings logged.",u.hG,"Three small quests each day. Never mandatory, never a penalty \u2014 simply XP you can earn.","Three returns",u.d,"One morning at a time. You can be proud of this step.","A professional was consulted.","One reminder only, after 3 silent days","One standard drink contains about 10 g of pure alcohol: half a pint of beer, a small glass of wine, or one measure of spirits. Home-poured drinks are often double.","A use was logged on the same day.",u.ex,"A craving rises, peaks, then subsides \u2014 usually within a few minutes, sometimes a little longer at first. You do not have to fight it; you only have to wait for it to pass. The four Ds on the SOS screen (Delay, Defer, Drink, Distract) are four ways to get through the peak. Every wave you cross without using makes the next one a little easier.",u.nT,u.X,u.mm,"One idea, right now","A first journal entry.",u.I,"YOUR GOALS","YOUR PROFILE","YOUR RHYTHM","Vaporizer","Alcoholic drink","Locked",u.uT,"Vitamin D after a blood test: 1,500\u20132,000 IU/day from October to April at 45\xb0 latitude.","See what comes next","Your data","Your data belongs to you",u.BJ,u.k4,u.gi,u.zj,"You can be proud of how far you have come.","weak","strong","moderate","\u2018Just one\u2019 reactivates the circuit precisely while it is fading. Risk is highest during the first weeks: prepare your response to triggers such as coffee, alcohol, and breaks instead of relying on willpower in the moment.","About","Upcoming","Age",u.sM,"Blank","Savings","Saved since the beginning","Immediate support","THC: what it can provide","THC: what it can cost","Assessment"],t.w)
